language-specific source files in `tools/hyphen-sources/` by
`tools/gen_hyphen.py`. The source files retain their upstream copyright
and license headers. Four migrated sources are pinned to
https://github.com/hyphenation/tex-hyphen at revision
5684c0f51c0b81133db2efbe60a408b4155a3ff5; their checksums are recorded
